OL,3,GNEWSACouncil proposes post-16 SEND
OL,4,Atravel changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of young people with special
OL,7,Feducational needs in Nottinghamshire
OL,8,Fcould end up contributing hundreds of
OL,9,Fpounds towards school transport.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire County Council is
OL,12,Fconsidering changes to its post-16
OL,13,Fhome-to-school transport service for
OL,14,Fstudents with special educational needs
OL,15,Fand disabilities (SEND) to save money.
OL,17,FThe Reform-led authority said the
OL,18,Fnumber of young people receiving the
OL,19,Fservice had nearly doubled over the
OL,20,Flast five years, with annual costs of
OL,21,Fabout #29m expected to increase to #35m
OL,22,Fin the next two years.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
